@page "/"
@rendermode InteractiveServer

<PageTitle>NewVistas — Home</PageTitle>

<h1>NewVistas Clinical Information System</h1>

<p>Welcome to NewVistas — a modern clinical information system built on Microsoft Orleans virtual actor technology, inspired by the VA's VistA EHR.</p>

<div class="home-grid">
    <div class="home-card">
        <h3>🔍 Patient Lookup</h3>
        <p>Search for patients by ID and view their clinical information.</p>
        <a href="/patient-lookup">Open Patient Lookup</a>
    </div>
    <div class="home-card">
        <h3>📋 Cover Sheet</h3>
        <p>CPRS-style cover sheet view — problems, meds, allergies, labs, vitals, appointments, and orders at a glance.</p>
        <a href="/cover-sheet">Open Cover Sheet</a>
    </div>
    <div class="home-card">
        <h3>🔬 Labs</h3>
        <p>Lab results with time-partitioned batch architecture for efficient access to current and historical results.</p>
        <a href="/labs">Open Labs</a>
    </div>
    <div class="home-card">
        <h3>📖 ICD-10 Codes</h3>
        <p>Search and browse ICD-10-CM diagnosis codes. Load codes from the CMS order file.</p>
        <a href="/icd10">Open ICD-10 Browser</a>
    </div>
</div>

<style>
    .home-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 1fr));
        gap: 1rem;
        margin-top: 1.5rem;
    }
    .home-card {
        border: 1px solid #d4d9e0;
        border-radius: 6px;
        padding: 1.25rem;
        background: #f9fafb;
    }
    .home-card h3 { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    .home-card p { margin: 0 0 0.75rem; color: #555; font-size: 0.85rem; }
    .home-card a {
        color: #003f72;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
    }
    .home-card a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
</style>
